guide forever/class/mage/nether-lace-garment
title Nether-lace Garment
category Class
class Mage
folder Mage
faction Horde
race Undead,Troll
levels 26-30
zone Orgrimmar
keywords Anastasia Hartwell, Speak with Deino, Waters of Xavian, Laughing Sisters, Raynewood Retreat, Ashenvale, Kil'hala, Crossroads, Nether-lace Robe, Nether-lace Tunic, Mage, class robe
reward item 7512 9515
why A robe or a tunic for Undead and Troll mages in their late 20s.

# The Horde mage robe at 26: Speak with Deino (1943), Waters of Xavian (1944),
# Laughing Sisters (1945) and Nether-lace Garment (1946).
# Sources: quests.json, npcs.json, objects.json and items.json for the chain,
# the Xavian Waterfall and the Laughing Sisters; Forever's Mage class
# quest list (data/local/quest-audit/, all four unchanged)
# and quest data (quests 1943, 1944, 1945 and
# 1946, checked 2026-10-14) for the races (Undead and Troll only: Orc mages
# have no level 26 robe quest) and the reward choice; the quest texts for the
# waterfall and Raynewood Retreat.
# Waters of Xavian needs Speak with Deino first (quests.json), and only
# Anastasia Hartwell in the Undercity gives it. Laughing Sisters opens only
# after Waters of Xavian, so Ashenvale is visited twice.

step Anastasia Hartwell
  zone Undercity
  tip Anastasia Hartwell stands in the Undercity's Magic Quarter. Trolls take the zeppelin from Orgrimmar to Tirisfal Glades for her.
  level 26
  accept 1943                                 -- Anastasia Hartwell

step Deino
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip Take the zeppelin to Orgrimmar. Deino is one of Orgrimmar's mage trainers.
  turnin 1943                                 -- Deino
  accept 1944

step The Xavian Waterfall
  zone Ashenvale
  tip Satyrs hold the ruins of Xavian in eastern Ashenvale. Fill Deino's Flask at the bottom of the highest waterfall.
  collect 7268 quest 1944.1                   -- Xavian Water Sample

step Back to Deino
  zone Orgrimmar
  turnin 1944                                 -- Deino
  accept 1945

step The Laughing Sisters
  zone Ashenvale
  tip The Laughing Sisters, dryads, gather near the Raynewood Retreat in central Ashenvale.
  collect 7270 quest 1945.1                   -- Laughing Sister's Hair

step Kil'hala
  zone The Barrens
  tip Kil'hala, a troll tailor, works at the Crossroads.
  turnin 1945                                 -- Kil'hala
  accept 1946
  turnin 1946 choose 7512 9515                -- Nether-lace Garment
